('second', 'second', '/ˈsɛkənd/', 'verb', 'a unit of time equal to one sixtieth of a minute', 'The whole recording lasts thirty seconds.', 'to formally support a proposal so it can be discussed', 'She seconded the motion, and debate began immediately.', ARRAY['moment','instant']::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], 'Medium', 83, 'Multiple Meanings', 1, ARRAY['multi-meaning']::text[], 'multiple-meaning set'),
